#: includes/admin/screen.php:1331
msgid "WPOptimizing is using only your local attribution — it is not receiving the shared attribution dataset that improves accuracy. Turn on sharing (opt-in and reciprocal) to give back and receive the community dataset."
msgstr "WPOptimizing verwendet nur deine lokale Zuordnung — es empfängt nicht den gemeinsamen Zuordnungsdatensatz, der die Genauigkeit verbessert. Aktiviere die Freigabe (Opt-in und gegenseitig), um beizutragen und den Community-Datensatz zu erhalten."

#: includes/admin/screen.php:1333
msgid "Enable sharing"
msgstr "Freigabe aktivieren"

#: includes/admin/screen.php:1374
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Willkommen"

#: includes/admin/screen.php:1378 includes/admin/trait-backups.php:196
#: includes/admin/trait-docs.php:36
